(7184717, 1104038, 173844, '<td valign="top">THE laugh out loud entry.  Graphically simple and bold. Perfect composition.  The seen-better-days sweatshirt really enhances the overall tone. And black and white is the only way to go.  My personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'THE laugh out loud entry.  Graphically simple and bold. Perfect composition.  The seen-better-days sweatshirt really enhances the overall tone. And black and white is the only way to go.  My personal favorite of the challenge.', '2014-03-03 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7184718, 1104141, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle humor here.  The timing of this shot had to be perfect, and it is.  The left half of this image seems superfluous, but it certainly gives a context and breathing room for the humor to play out.  My second favorite.</td>', 'I like the subtle humor here.  The timing of this shot had to be perfect, and it is.  The left half of this image seems superfluous, but it certainly gives a context and breathing room for the humor to play out.  My second favorite.', '2014-03-03 16:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7184720, 1104179, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yeah, both expressions are priceless.  Funny set-up that seems to anticipate how it''ll all end up.  Nice and clean, in concept and outcome.</td>', 'Yeah, both expressions are priceless.  Funny set-up that seems to anticipate how it''ll all end up.  Nice and clean, in concept and outcome.', '2014-03-03 16:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7184721, 1104226, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very funny idea.  The man''s somewhat disheveled coat and almost furtive cast out of the garden look of resignation say as much as the writing on the wall.  The grungy processing rounds it out.</td>', 'Very funny idea.  The man''s somewhat disheveled coat and almost furtive cast out of the garden look of resignation say as much as the writing on the wall.  The grungy processing rounds it out.', '2014-03-03 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7185094, 1103751, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cartoonish distortion -- works every time.  Why it works, I guess, is the severity of departure from the normal context within which it''s placed.  The positioning of the braying horse is perfect.  Everyone else seems to be searching for an errant golf ball.</td>', 'Cartoonish distortion -- works every time.  Why it works, I guess, is the severity of departure from the normal context within which it''s placed.  The positioning of the braying horse is perfect.  Everyone else seems to be searching for an errant golf ball.', '2014-03-04 14:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7185098, 1104135, 173844, '<td valign="top">This has a Gary Larson-ish feel to it, which means it''s quirky and funny.  That hapless look is gold.  The everyday setting works well, and you have a nice cast of co-conspirators.  Underwear man looks like the little man in the red traffic light.</td>', 'This has a Gary Larson-ish feel to it, which means it''s quirky and funny.  That hapless look is gold.  The everyday setting works well, and you have a nice cast of co-conspirators.  Underwear man looks like the little man in the red traffic light.', '2014-03-04 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7185101, 1104102, 173844, '<td valign="top">That look is all.  The narrow focus on the cat''s face certainly nails it.  Even sitting out here in virtualland I feel cowed.</td>', 'That look is all.  The narrow focus on the cat''s face certainly nails it.  Even sitting out here in virtualland I feel cowed.', '2014-03-04 14:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
