(7186644, 1103865, 28742, '<td valign="top">I can guess as to what happened here - even though your text is "legal", many voters might think it is not and regardless of all the warnings to "vote as if it''s legal", many voters slam what they assume is illegal. Just a hunch, but a little research would probably prove it out. The key to some expert editing challenges its to nail the topic concept <i>without</i> "expert" editing and you are more than capable of both conept and execution within advanced editing. Look at the winners, for example (except for gyaban). Another factor is that the "I don''t always..." meme is overplayed. FWIW, I gave it a 7.<br/> <br/>My two pennies anyway. Hope it was helpful. Don''t let it get ya down - you''re still a Master and we all know it. :)</td>', 'I can guess as to what happened here - even though your text is "legal", many voters might think it is not and regardless of all the warnings to "vote as if it''s legal", many voters slam what they assume is illegal. Just a hunch, but a little research would probably prove it out. The key to some expert editing challenges its to nail the topic concept without "expert" editing and you are more than capable of both conept and execution within advanced editing. Look at the winners, for example (except for gyaban). Another factor is that the "I don''t always..." meme is overplayed. FWIW, I gave it a 7. My two pennies anyway. Hope it was helpful. Don''t let it get ya down - you''re still a Master and we all know it. :)', '2014-03-07 01:13:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7186647, 1104038, 61396, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2014-03-07 01:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
