(7186813, 1104179, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Jen! What a funny image, I like it a lot. Not mentioning I am fond of cats (did you know my last name means ''kitty'' in Polish?), so I''m very glad yours won :)</td>', 'Congratulations Jen! What a funny image, I like it a lot. Not mentioning I am fond of cats (did you know my last name means ''kitty'' in Polish?), so I''m very glad yours won :)', '2014-03-07 04:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7186819, 1104180, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Love it Christophe!  How''d you do the lightsaber? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot Susan! <br/>For the lightsaber, I used a plastic toy, that I dismembered in 2 parts, photographed separately: the handle first, then the blade itself. Since the latter was made of translucent plastic, I used black cardboard as a custom adapter to a studio strobe: this setup permitted me to obtain realistic reflections on the tank. Then in post-processing I enhanced the colors and added a ''glow'' effect.</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Love it Christophe!  How''d you do the lightsaber?   Thanks a lot Susan! For the lightsaber, I used a plastic toy, that I dismembered in 2 parts, photographed separately: the handle first, then the blade itself. Since the latter was made of translucent plastic, I used black cardboard as a custom adapter to a studio strobe: this setup permitted me to obtain realistic reflections on the tank. Then in post-processing I enhanced the colors and added a ''glow'' effect.', '2014-03-07 05:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7186824, 1104263, 114969, '<td valign="top">Yay for cats! I''m sure they would be incredibly hard to beat at Poker: when they decide to, they can be unreadable. The lighting and colors harmony are perfect once again Samantha, congratulations on the top 5 :)</td>', 'Yay for cats! I''m sure they would be incredibly hard to beat at Poker: when they decide to, they can be unreadable. The lighting and colors harmony are perfect once again Samantha, congratulations on the top 5 :)', '2014-03-07 05:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7186827, 1104253, 114969, '<td valign="top">I''m very surprised of the score this obtained, it deserves way more in my opinion! The scene is funny, I love your both expressions watching all those unexpectedly flying toys fooling around :) The angle is also clever and works perfectly with the action. Better luck next time I suppose :-/</td>', 'I''m very surprised of the score this obtained, it deserves way more in my opinion! The scene is funny, I love your both expressions watching all those unexpectedly flying toys fooling around :) The angle is also clever and works perfectly with the action. Better luck next time I suppose :-/', '2014-03-07 05:52:53.000000', NULL, 0),
