(7186870, 1104038, 153814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> YES! Great job &amp; congrats! Tell me this woulda been legal in Basic or Advanced...? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ken this COULD have been legal in basic or advanced if it was shot correctly the first time. It''s a mix of 2 shots with bad angles. IF it was shot correctly the first time then YES it would have been legal in basic or advanced.<br/> <br/>I thought for sure we would be seeing one of your masterpieces on the front page of the humor challenge. What happened?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-03-07 07:30:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: YES! Great job & congrats! Tell me this woulda been legal in Basic or Advanced...?   Ken this COULD have been legal in basic or advanced if it was shot correctly the first time. It''s a mix of 2 shots with bad angles. IF it was shot correctly the first time then YES it would have been legal in basic or advanced. I thought for sure we would be seeing one of your masterpieces on the front page of the humor challenge. What happened?', '2014-03-07 07:27:56.000000', '2014-03-07 07:30:59.000000', 0),
